     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restarts, shared across tabs. Most convenient, but persists on disk and obliges a clear-on-logout
[39m     [38;5;246mpath in this same change.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Cookie
     [38;5;246mPersists and is sent to the server automatically. Right choice if the backend needs the ID; needs [39m
